# Use operations from TypeScript

Operations model caller-visible asynchronous workflows.

```trellis
operation Reports.Generate {
  input = GenerateReportInput;
  update = GenerateReportUpdate;
  output = GenerateReportOutput;
  cancel = true;
  capability start = ["reports.generate"];
}
```

Generated clients expose typed start, watch, cancel, and signal surfaces selected by the participant artifact.
